      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Andrew Deftereos of Leonard Wilson Keenan is delighted to present 26 Park Avenue , clongriffen  to the market. This fabulous home has been loved and improved to a high standard by its proud current owners who have created a stylish and well-designed haven. Its excellent location and East facing garden add to its superiority. A stunning family home it is the perfect property to upgrade to or for those requiring a superior property and investors alike.\r\n\r\nThis most spacious house type consists of: Entrance hall, living room, kitchen / dining room, utility room and guest toilet. The first floor consists of landing, living room / bedroom, further bedroom & bathroom. The second floor consists of landing, primary bedroom with en suite bathroom and further bedroom.\r\n\r\nThe many features of this lovely home include: Quality flooring throughout, modern fitted kitchen with an abundance of base and eye level storage to include all integrated appliances, doors from kitchen leading to garden, fitted wardrobes in 3 of the bedrooms and quality tiling and sanitary ware in all bathrooms. No. 26 also boasts double glazed windows and energy efficient central heating system. To the front there is a driveway with parking for 2 cars. To the rear is lovely east facing garden. There is also the beautiful Father collins park opposite the property.\r\n\r\nBaldoyle, Portmarnock, Malahide & Raheny Villages are all within easy reach. Northern Cross & Clarehall Shopping Centre are literally on your doorstep.There is an excellent selection of both primary and secondary schools within the immediate area.\r\n\r\nThe area is further serviced by an excellent bus route together with Dart Station in Clongriffin making the city most accessible. The M50 / M1 Motorways and Dublin International Airport are also close to hand making this a most strategically positioned address.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
